# Cloudflare Pages — files excluded from the deployed asset bundle.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/binding/#ignoring-assets
#
# pages_build_output_dir is "." (wrangler.toml), so EVERY committed file in
# the repo root would otherwise be uploaded and publicly fetchable. Most
# non-web files are saved by Pages' extension handling (.md/.sh/.toml/.sql
# fall through to the SPA), but that is incidental behaviour, not a
# guarantee — anything listed here is excluded explicitly.
#
# Verified 2026-07-28 by byte-comparing every committed text file against
# its live URL: cron-worker/index.js and .claude/settings.json were the two
# files being served verbatim that should not have been.

# Standalone Worker — deployed on its own via `cd cron-worker && npx wrangler
# deploy` (Pages Functions cannot take cron triggers). It is NOT part of the
# site. Serving it published the D1 table inventory (auth_sessions,
# magic_link_tokens, audit_log, billing/triage tables) plus the shape of the
# backup and NPS-dispatch endpoints — reconnaissance value, no secrets.
cron-worker/

# Agent/editor configuration — never web content.
.claude/
.github/

# Repo documentation and operational runbooks. Currently saved by extension
# handling; excluded explicitly so a future Pages change cannot expose them.
*.md
!education/**/*.md

# Deploy scripts and infrastructure config.
*.sh
*.toml
schema/
scripts/
docs/

# Build/design source that should never be public.
cite_audit/verify_run.log
